Ⲹ</div>"},{"id":"marker44","name":"Swamertonbu Idol","legend":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༷ༀ༪༯༡༮༢༁༷༿༤༚༁༼༠༅ༀ༙༼༐༩༗༐༢༫༥༶༡༌༁༜༨༶༻༸༪་༣༜༿༊༪༷༯༹༖༕༂༪༅༂༢༛༻༤༆༹༚༾༤༳༬༜༇༂༐༛༦༐༥༣༗༉༭་༁༅༘༇༿༐༩༱༪༄༭ༀ</div>"},{"id":"marker45","name":"Birlowbury Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">የፀዘወደወሠ ቀበሀየገለፈለጰበመፈሐዐደተሠሐረጰረፈዐቀ ሰፐየ ደ ጠወደከጸተነጠኀጰፈለሀጰሐፈረዐዐቀ ሰፐ ወሀጸሰበጰ</div>"},{"id":"marker46","name":"Floksey Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">መሐየየሐሠፀሠ ለከ ጠጸበፈከደቀደደለጰዘከጠ  ዐጸነኀሰሠጰለኀ ሰወጠጠኀዘዐሀዘረተከሐገደ አበነገዐጸፐ ጠ መገኀከቀነዘሀነፐ</div>"},{"id":"marker47","name":"Nostondal Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⳓ⳹⳹Ⳳ⳹ⳚⳤⳂⳁⳄ⳧ⳃⳊⳖⳔⲲⳎ⳹ⳭⲲⳞⲲ ⳤ⳩ⳒⲼ ⳭⲴⳌⳫ⳩ⳃ⳩ⳄⳔⲲⳌ⳾ⳜⳤⳖ⳪ⳁⳘⳤ⳥ⳲⳘⳭ⳩ⳖⳔⲺⳢⳠⲼⲴ⳾ⳂⳬⳆ⳪⳪ⳫⳀⲺⳀⳢ⳧ⳠⳊⳐ⳹ⳃ Ⳍ⳩ⲾⳫⳒⳬ</div>"},{"id":"marker48","name":"Ruined Mausoleum","legend":"Ruins of an ancient mausoleum. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker49","name":"Ruined City","legend":"Ruins of an ancient city. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker50","name":"Ruined Fort","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fort. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker51","name":"Ruined Fortress","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortress. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker52","name":"Ruined Temple","legend":"Ruins of an ancient temple. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker53","name":"Ruined Mausoleum","legend":"Ruins of an ancient mausoleum. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker54","name":"Ruined Stronghold","legend":"Ruins of an ancient stronghold. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker55","name":"Ruined Fortification","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortification. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker56","name":"Broneytes Library","legend":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"id":"marker57","name":"Travelling World-famous Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this world-famous circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker58","name":"Travelling Breathtaking Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this breathtaking circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker59","name":"Warleigh Tournament","legend":"Warriors from around the land gather for a tournament of brutality in Warleigh, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor."},{"id":"marker60","name":"Horsmouthel Fair","legend":"A fair is being held in Horsmouthel, with all manner of local and foreign goods and services on offer."},{"id":"marker61","name":"Minor Jetty","legend":"A small location along the Grantesto River to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"id":"marker62","name":"Oxen migration","legend":"A huge group of oxen are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker63","name":"Redckingham fete","legend":"A fete has been organised at Redckingham as a chance to gather the great and the good of the area together to be merry, make alliances and scheme around the crisis."},{"id":"marker64","name":"Thaxtedbute Cave","legend":"The Thaxtedbute Cave. Locals claim that it is the home of strange monsters."},{"id":"marker65","name":"Tareven Sepulchre","legend":"This ethereal necropolis seems suspended between the realms of the living and the dead. Wisps of mist dance around the tombstones, while haunting melodies linger in the air, commemorating the departed."},{"id":"marker66","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/6680\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></if